# Enemy SPLASH shell (Lobber shot): a big slow sphere with a team-1 mini-field - player emitter
# fields brake and deflect it in flight. On ANY contact it damages EVERY enemy-team unit and
# structure within SplashRadius of the impact (GameProjectileComponent::onContact), then despawns.
Prefab gameEnemyLob
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Sphere
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.6 0.2 1
		Scale 0.45
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Layer Projectile
		Shape Sphere
		Radius 0.45
		Density 140
		Restitution 0.1
		ContactEvents true
	Component Force
		Team 1
		Output 0.5
		Reach 2
		Centered true
		AnalyticReadback true
	Component Network
	Component GameProjectile
		UnitDamage 12
		StructureDamage 18
		Lifetime 7
		EmitterDrain 20
		EmitterDrainRadius 6
		SplashRadius 3
